.gitignore
# Screenshots, when there are some: reference them by absolute
# raw.githubusercontent URL (vsce mangles relative ones from a monorepo
# subdirectory), so the Marketplace fetches them from GitHub rather than the
# .vsix carrying a second copy nothing reads.
media/screenshots/**
